---
layout: base.njk
pageType: sys
noindex: true
---
{#- /<locale>/sys/: one language's system page (D56), linked from /sys/. It lists every hidden page of the language and the
    language's files, and links /sys/ (style guide and HTML element reference, D59) and the other languages' system pages at the top. The language switcher pairs
    the system pages; the prose is English on every one, so the content block is lang="en" dir="ltr" outside English. Built from the page collection. -#}
{%- set link = "underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink-brand focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus" -%}
{%- set hiddenPages = collections.all | sysPages("hidden", locale) -%}
{%- set row = "flex flex-col gap-1 px-4 py-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between sm:gap-6" -%}
<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-4 pt-16 pb-24 sm:px-6 md:pt-24 lg:px-8"{% if locale != "en" %} lang="en" dir="ltr"{% endif %}>
<p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-brand"><a href="/sys/" class="{{ link }}">System</a></p>
<h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-balance">{{ title }}</h1>
<p class="mt-4 text-lg text-ink-muted">Every hidden page and file in this language. Not in the sitemap, not linked from a public page, not indexed.</p>

<nav aria-label="System pages" class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-sm"><a href="/sys/" class="font-mono {{ link }}">/sys/</a>{% for l in site.locales %}{% if l != locale %}<a href="/{{ l }}/sys/" hreflang="{{ l }}" class="font-mono {{ link }}">/{{ l }}/sys/</a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</nav>

<section id="sys-hidden" class="mt-16 scroll-mt-24" aria-labelledby="sys-hidden-h">
<h2 id="sys-hidden-h" class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Hidden pages <span class="text-base font-normal text-ink-muted">({{ hiddenPages.length }})</span></h2>
<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-muted">Real pages that ask not to be indexed: search results, thank-you pages, tag archives, error pages, the framed newsletter issue. Only this language's; the language switcher leads to the others' system pages.</p>
<ul class="mt-4 divide-y divide-line rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface-raised">
{%- for p in hiddenPages %}
<li class="{{ row }}"><a href="{{ p.url }}" class="font-medium {{ link }}">{{ p.title }}</a><code class="text-sm text-ink-muted">{{ p.url }}</code></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
</section>

<section id="sys-files" class="mt-16 scroll-mt-24" aria-labelledby="sys-files-h">
<h2 id="sys-files-h" class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Files in this language</h2>
<ul class="mt-4 divide-y divide-line rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface-raised">
{%- for f in [["/" + locale + "/feed.xml", "Atom feed"], ["/assets/files/" + locale + "/office-map.svg", "Office map picture"], ["/assets/files/" + locale + "/line-notes-12.vtt", "Podcast captions"], ["/assets/files/" + locale + "/hamburg.vcf", "Contact card, Hamburg"]] %}
<li class="{{ row }}"><a href="{{ f[0] }}" class="font-medium {{ link }}">{{ f[1] }}</a><code class="text-sm text-ink-muted">{{ f[0] }}</code></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
</section>

</div>
